    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Welcome aboard\nBOAC\nThis issue is\na Christmas present",
      "Tommy Steele, who bas been looking\nforward to playing Santa Claus for years,\nis on the front cover with some of the\ngifts he's chosen.\nInside we give you a traditional\nChristmas dinner, a ticket forthe panto-\nmime, a new Christmas game, atripto\nthe Caribbean in search of pirates and a\ndetective story.\nYoudon'thave towaittill December\n25th to read it."
